{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>馬鞍山發生交通意外。今日（25日）晚上8時許，據報一輛私家車沿鞍祿街行駛，途至近新港城中心對開時，疑失控撞向行人路鐵欄，繼而翻側，車頭擱在行人路上。</p><p>意外中有兩名乘客受傷。女乘客報稱鼻痛及頭暈，男乘客則報稱頸痛，兩人清醒由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。警方正調查車禍成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"私家車撞欄翻側，車頭擱在行人路上。(圖片來源：車cam L（香港群組）)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191148419339653120658310.jpeg/e9PkDpSEiwwuWRkD9wukXCyMGbbrA3SE2plVh9qZVYc\"/><figcaption>私家車撞欄翻側，車頭擱在行人路上。(圖片來源：車cam L（香港群組）)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車撞欄翻側，車頭擱在行人路上。(圖片來源：車cam L（香港群組）)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191148417041043456130597.jpeg/aLbyzELG6FAS9EPegE7_no3Zxr5x41V-hgMZmIYDGZg\"/><figcaption>私家車撞欄翻側，車頭擱在行人路上。(圖片來源：車cam L（香港群組）)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.853756+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:28:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:55.109684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:12.269562+00:00","content_hash":"76d445bbfc513aa509f3276031efdfb61d56b0217aeb61eb8f3d458a77e42bd9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}